#### Cach 2: Gui chuoi Base64 qua JSON
```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/mrz \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"image": "data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQ..."}'
