#### Cach 3: Gui URL anh tu xa
```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/mrz \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"url": "https://example.com/passport-sample.jpg"}'
```

#### Cach 4: Gui duong dan tep noi bo tren may chu
```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/api/mrz \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
